        390.3011169433594
      ],
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        397.00701904296875,
        527.59716796875,
        411.4500427246094
      ],
      "text": "No randomized controlled trials that addressed the objectives of this systematic review were identified.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96479320526123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        410.2070007324219,
        527.1244506835938,
        424.6500244140625
      ],
      "text": "Hence, no high-quality evidence on the efficacy of FQ-based TPT for MDR-TB contacts was found. All",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981935501098633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        423.4070129394531,
        527.1668090820312,
        437.85003662109375
      ],
      "text": "the observational studies identified had problems of selection bias and small samples; none suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962937355041504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        436.60699462890625,
        527.1876831054688,
        451.0500183105469
      ],
      "text": "any significant benefit of use of FQ-based TPT to prevent development of MDR-TB disease. Although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988243103027344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        449.8070068359375,
        527.4398803710938,
        464.2500305175781
      ],
      "text": "the quality of evidence was low, the results from larger observational studies suggest that FQ-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        463.00701904296875,
        527.4180297851562,
        477.4500427246094
      ],
      "text": "TPT is safe for use among MDR-TB contacts. No grade 3, 4 or serious adverse events related to Lfx",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        476.20703125,
        527.4392700195312,
        490.6500549316406
      ],
      "text": "or MFX were reported, and FQ monotherapy had high completion rates and acceptability. Mild or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        489.4070129394531,
        527.5457763671875,
        503.85003662109375
      ],
      "text": "moderate adverse events were observed in children and adolescents. A high-quality modelling study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989895820617676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        502.60699462890625,
        527.2254638671875,
        517.0499877929688
      ],
      "text": "evaluating cost-effectiveness found that targeting the highest risk groups – children < 5 or < 15 years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987893104553223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        515.8070068359375,
        527.6034545898438,
        530.25
      ],
      "text": "with HIV – was the most cost-effective, but provision of FQ TPT to all contacts <  15 years would have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        529.0070190429688,
        527.394775390625,
        543.4500122070312
      ],
      "text": "greater impact and still be more cost-effective than detection of prevalent TB disease alone. Higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        542.20703125,
        527.4202880859375,
        556.6500244140625
      ],
      "text": "quality evidence is necessary on the efficacy of FQ-based TPT for prevention of MDR-TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
